.git
# Docker matches patterns against the full path from the context root, so a bare
# `__pycache__` only matches ./__pycache__. These need `**/` to catch nested ones.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.coverage
htmlcov
dist/
.tailwind
.env
.env.local
docs/
tests/
.github/
.superpowers/
.pre-commit-config.yaml
